  speakerName: Ending
  dialogue:
  - dialogueLine: You accepted the corruption that filled your soul.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: When you were asked whether or not you wanted to go home or to
      stay in the future forever, you stayed in a heartbeat.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: After all, your new purpose in life was to dedicate everything
      you had to your viewers and your sponsors, no matter the cost.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: But eventually, this overwhelming devotion came crashing to a halt.
      You were appealing to viewers too much, and in doing so, drove them out instead.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: Continued efforts to salvage your failing stream all ended in utter
      failure.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: You were soon deemed unift to continue content creation. But you
      found peace, knowing your stress would soon end.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: '"Never regret thy fall, O Icarus of the fearless flight, For the
      greatest tragedy of them all, Is never to feel the burning light."'
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: Goodbye, Mr. Knight.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: 'Ending F: Icarus.'
